# browser rune (Unicode code point) predicates, via the linked rune runtime shim (host Unicode tables). Internal: reached only through the public rune API.

dock load
  load <global:rune>, name rune

task scalar-is-letter
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-letter
      read code

task scalar-is-number
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-number
      read code

task scalar-is-whitespace
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-whitespace
      read code

task scalar-is-uppercase
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-uppercase
      read code

task scalar-is-lowercase
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-lowercase
      read code

task scalar-is-alphanumeric
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-alphanumeric
      read code

task scalar-is-control
  take code, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call rune/is-control
      read code

task scalar-to-uppercase
  take code, like number
  like number
  send back
    call rune/to-uppercase
      read code

task scalar-to-lowercase
  take code, like number
  like number
  send back
    call rune/to-lowercase
      read code
